.ends nor2x4

* maj3x1
* PUN: (A+B).(B+C).(A+C) - worst case 3 PMOS in series -> W=3.00u
* PDN: AB+BC+AC          - worst case 2 NMOS in series -> W=0.84u
.subckt maj3x1 A B C Y VDD VSS
* PUN
XP0 mid0 A VDD  VDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=3.00u l=0.15u
XP1 mid0 B VDD  VDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=3.00u l=0.15u
XP2 mid1 B mid0 VDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=3.00u l=0.15u
XP3 mid1 C mid0 VDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=3.00u l=0.15u
